<tr><td style="border:solid #D9DCE6 1pt;padding:4pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt">Spam massif ou abus de l’endpoint public</td><td style="border:solid #D9DCE6 1pt;padding:4pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt">Élevée</td><td style="border:solid #D9DCE6 1pt;padding:4pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt">Moyen</td><td style="border:solid #D9DCE6 1pt;padding:4pt 6pt;font-size:9.5pt">Limitation de débit, Turnstile, quotas</td></tr>
